#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:32 973ddb531521418196131b3efb6a14ea
msgid ""
"**Description**: Download and parse NHANES XPT data files from CDC into "
"structured JSON (DataFrame-ready). Bridges dataset discovery to analysis "
"by handling XPT download, parsing, optional variable selection, and age "
"filtering. For standard components (Demographics, Dietary, "
"Examination/BodyMeasures, Questionnaire), the tool auto-resolves the "
"filename from the cycle suffix. For Laboratory data, provide the exact "
"dataset\\_name (e.g., 'CBC', 'BIOPRO', 'GHB', 'GLU', 'TRIGLY', 'HDL', "
"'TCHOL'). Returns column metadata, summary statistics, and the first 5000"
" rows as JSON records. Use nhanes\\_search\\_datasets first to discover "
"available dataset names if unsure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:84
#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:117 0bc1c522626e4ad8857359cd2e7e9e26
#: 24b133b37bec40308001724ec324af29 f002f00742504675a8fdee7fc25df5df
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:36 d61d2af79d044ec5b300d69c99106a9e
msgid ""
"``component`` (string) (required) NHANES component category. 'Dietary' = "
"Day 1 intake totals (DR1TOT), 'DietaryDay2' = Day 2 (DR2TOT), "
"'BodyMeasures' = BMX, 'Examination' = general exam. For Laboratory, also "
"provide dataset\\_name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:39 e06b7808d824477aba95345603461ba2
msgid ""
"``cycle`` (string) (required) NHANES survey cycle (e.g., '2017-2018', "
"'2015-2016', '2013-2014', '2011-2012')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:42 7c84b4b1c83e4ffc93ea2299ba36c7fa
msgid ""
"``dataset_name`` (string) (optional) Exact NHANES dataset filename prefix"
" (without cycle suffix). Required for Laboratory (e.g., 'CBC', 'BIOPRO', "
"'GHB', 'GLU', 'TRIGLY', 'HDL', 'TCHOL'). Optional for other components to"
" override the default filename."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:45 fa5b769576eb411298a74dba57ef7bc0
msgid ""
"``variables`` (array) (optional) List of variable names to select (e.g., "
"['SEQN', 'DR1TIRON', 'DR1TKCAL']). SEQN is always included. If omitted, "
"all variables are returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:48 519f406bdcfd4f02978d6be5ff1a0606
msgid ""
"``age_min`` (number) (optional) Minimum age filter (inclusive). Filters "
"by RIDAGEYR from Demographics. Auto-merges with DEMO file if the "
"requested component is not Demographics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:51 c213e6365fe244c2aea23fa97dc7fac7
msgid ""
"``age_max`` (number) (optional) Maximum age filter (inclusive). Filters "
"by RIDAGEYR from Demographics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nhanes_tools.rst:54 3bd35175eb944841b2a198df2a21ab6d
msgid ""
"``max_rows`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of data rows to return "
"(default: 5000). Set lower for faster responses."
msgstr ""

